const airports={昆明:{display:'昆明'},陇川:{display:'陇川（瑞丽）'},兰坪:{display:'兰坪'},凤庆:{display:'凤庆'}};const params=new URLSearchParams(location.search),from=params.get('from')||'昆明',to=params.get('to')||'陇川',farePrice=Number(params.get('price'))||299,fareName=params.get('fare')||'基础经济舱';let baggagePrice=0,seatPrice=0,seatName='';
document.querySelector('#route').textContent=`${airports[from]?.display||from} → ${airports[to]?.display||to}`;document.querySelector('#flight-summary').textContent=`${params.get('flight')||'JH1203'} · 运-12F · ${params.get('date')||''}`;document.querySelector('#fare-name').textContent=fareName;document.querySelector('#fare-price').textContent=farePrice;if(params.get('baggage')==='included')document.querySelector('#included-baggage').textContent='当前票价已含基础托运行李额度。您仍可按需增加额度。';
function updateTotal(){const extras=baggagePrice+seatPrice,parts=[];if(baggagePrice)parts.push(`行李 ¥${baggagePrice}`);if(seatName)parts.push(`座位 ${seatName}`);document.querySelector('#extras-description').textContent=parts.join(' · ')||'未添加';document.querySelector('#extras-price').textContent=extras;document.querySelector('#total-price').textContent=farePrice+extras;document.querySelector('#continue-button').textContent=(baggagePrice||seatName)?'确认附加服务，继续':'跳过，无需附加服务'}
document.querySelectorAll('#baggage-options button').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('#baggage-options button').forEach(item=>item.classList.remove('selected'));button.classList.add('selected');baggagePrice=Number(button.dataset.price);document.querySelector('#baggage-status').textContent=baggagePrice?`已添加额外行李 · ¥${baggagePrice}`:'尚未添加额外行李';updateTotal()}));
const occupied=new Set(['2B','4A','5C']),seatMap=document.querySelector('#seat-map');for(let row=1;row<=6;row++){const line=document.createElement('div');line.className='seat-row';['A','B','row','C'].forEach(code=>{if(code==='row'){const label=document.createElement('small');label.textContent=row;line.append(label);return}const name=`${row}${code}`,button=document.createElement('button');button.type='button';button.className=`seat${row<=2?' front':''}${occupied.has(name)?' occupied':''}`;button.textContent=name;button.disabled=occupied.has(name);button.addEventListener('click',()=>{document.querySelectorAll('.seat.chosen').forEach(item=>item.classList.remove('chosen'));if(seatName===name){seatName='';seatPrice=0}else{seatName=name;seatPrice=row<=2?10:0;button.classList.add('chosen')}document.querySelector('#seat-status').textContent=seatName?`已选择 ${seatName} · ¥${seatPrice}`:'尚未选择座位';document.querySelector('#selected-seat').textContent=seatName||'未选择';document.querySelector('#seat-price').textContent=`¥${seatPrice}`;updateTotal()});line.append(button)});seatMap.append(line)}
document.querySelectorAll('.collapse').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const body=button.closest('.service-card').querySelector('.service-body'),hidden=body.hidden;body.hidden=!hidden;button.textContent=hidden?'⌃':'⌄'}));document.querySelector('#continue-button').addEventListener('click',()=>{const next=new URLSearchParams(params);next.set('price',String(farePrice));next.set('fare',fareName);next.set('baggageExtra',String(baggagePrice));next.set('seat',seatName);next.set('seatPrice',String(seatPrice));next.set('total',String(farePrice+baggagePrice+seatPrice));location.href=`passenger.html?${next}`});updateTotal();



